  "results": [
    {
      "textGroupId": "translation-chunk-0005-u003",
      "targetTextSha256": "6c77f508b73cc16ba513ff208e9e024c3e2f281651446e14c66ae5abb3e9028f",
      "audioSha256": "e059178c3d8533d113d9196b8d2269dfcb945b16c02e01ddc3419f1bfa0cc59f",
      "recognized": "强烈的劲头是它的核心特质，所以它做任何事都带着这股强烈的劲头。",
      "similarity": 1.0,
      "differences": [],
      "status": "pass"
    },
    {
      "textGroupId": "translation-chunk-0005-u004",
      "targetTextSha256": "de5952460ae0e821c05d9b3af3a04e4815e9a3aa3c632e69a13f87a17014e387",
      "audioSha256": "6a312102ca5c03dfe48443d8cccd1f24e24569f3711a16aec10ba6b26f68d842",
      "recognized": "所以，同样地，神出于他圣洁这一核心属性，做任何事的方式，在道德上都是完全无瑕的。",
      "similarity": 1.0,
      "differences": [],
      "status": "pass"
    },
    {
      "textGroupId": "translation-chunk-0005-u005",
      "targetTextSha256": "86f23b02fb9a412e1da3c510753cb4c386d2887b0ffe3291a73fcac128f1a70a",
      "audioSha256": "bb6ef472896b60831fa0df093457784802d7bb11b44e2700dcf34ebc6e1c2b15",
      "recognized": "这也就是说，如果神发出这些神圣的警告，他会以什么方式来做呢？",
      "similarity": 1.0,
      "differences": [],
      "status": "pass"
    },
    {
      "textGroupId": "translation-chunk-0005-u006",
      "targetTextSha256": "aedab7893e28290288f53fa69b152d3cbb1ddacdba3e314c3422254063af5599",
      "audioSha256": "d4bd49ee59a57f0294074708b2c89b20326dbfb3ae9271c10dc55892a8eae0fd",
      "recognized": "以道德上完全无瑕的方式。",
      "similarity": 1.0,
      "differences": [],
      "status": "pass"
    },
    {
      "textGroupId": "translation-chunk-0005-u007",
      "targetTextSha256": "49b9a41e593bb4638cac594fea9d6f664d8b866172de94c5a14867d116c329e2",
      "audioSha256": "7ffdcd4406167742f357143deafd7b70139d231828a7214e591e15262eec94a3",
      "recognized": "正因如此，特别令人惊叹的是，当我们看第八章时，在神的警告，也就是浩筒的警告，还没有发出之前。",
      "similarity": 0.975,
      "differences": [
        {
          "kind": "replace",
